---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "What to Pack for China — Seasons & Climate Guide";
const description = "What to pack for China based on seasons and cities — from Beijing winters to Guangzhou summers.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Life
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🎒 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        What to Pack for China<br class="hidden md:block" />: Seasons & Climate Guide
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">中国的包装是不同的——这是你真正需要的。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>中国有极端的季节变化。</strong> Beijing in winter is freezing (-10°C), while Guangzhou in summer is sweltering (35°C+ with humidity). The key is packing layers and preparing for the specific cities and seasons you'll visit. Across the board: comfortable walking shoes, a power bank, toilet paper, and a reusable water bottle are essentials regardless of season.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#year-round" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎒 全年必备</a></li>
        <li><a href="#spring" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌸 春季（三月至五月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#summer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">☀️ 夏季（6月至8月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#autumn" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍂 秋季（九月至十一月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#winter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❄️ 冬季（12月至2月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#city-guide" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏙️ 城市快速指南</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="year-round" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎒</span> Year-Round Essentials
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">无论何时何地，这些物品都应该放在你的包里：</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">项目</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">为什么</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>充电宝</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">手机电池在导航+翻译+支付时快速耗尽</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>通用旅行适配器</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">中国使用A/I型插座（220V）</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>便携式卫生纸/纸巾</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">许多公共厕所不提供纸张</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>洗手液</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">并非所有地方都有肥皂</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>可重复使用的水瓶</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">酒店和车站都有热水机</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>舒适的步行鞋</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">你平均每天走15000多步</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>一个小背包/背包</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">并非所有景点都允许携带大包</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>护照和签证复印件</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">也保留数字副本</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>重要提示：</strong> For domestic flights and high-speed rail security checks, power banks are required to bear a 3C certification mark and have a capacity of no more than 20,000 mAh. If you plan to visit multiple cities in China, it is recommended that you purchase a qualified power bank in the first city you arrive in.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="spring" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌸</span> Spring (March–May)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong> 10°C–25°C (Beijing cooler, Guangzhou warmer)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>条件：</strong> Mild but unpredictable. Rain likely in April–May, especially in the south.</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">包装：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Light jacket or hoodie (essential — spring evenings can be cold)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Long pants and long-sleeve shirts</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> An umbrella or light rain jacket</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> A scarf (useful for wind and dust)</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="summer" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">☀️</span> Summer (June–August)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong> 25°C–40°C (Beijing dry heat, Guangzhou/Shanghai humid)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>条件：</strong> Hot everywhere. Southern cities are especially humid. Monsoon rain common.</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">包装：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Light, breathable clothing (cotton, linen)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Sunscreen (SPF 50+)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Sunglasses and a hat</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> An umbrella (for both sun and rain)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> Many attractions (Forbidden City, Great Wall) have minimal shade — plan accordingly</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="autumn" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍂</span> Autumn (September–November)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong> 5°C–22°C (cooling down, comfortable)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>条件：</strong> The most pleasant season. Clear skies, cool air, low humidity.</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">包装：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Layers: t-shirt + light jacket or sweater</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Jeans or comfortable pants</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> A mid-weight jacket for evenings</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> This is the ideal season for outdoor activities</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="winter" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❄️</span> Winter (December–February)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong> -15°C (Beijing/Harbin) to 15°C (Guangzhou/Shenzhen)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>条件：</strong> Freezing in the north, mild in the south. Dry air with low humidity.</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">包（北方；南方像秋天）：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Heavy winter coat / down jacket (essential for Beijing, Xi'an, or anywhere north)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Thermal underwear (if visiting the north)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Hat, gloves, scarf — non-negotiable in winter</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Lip balm and moisturizer (central heating dries out skin)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> Harbin can reach -30°C — pack extreme cold gear if going that far north</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="city-guide" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏙️</span> City-by-City Quick Guide
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">亮点</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">夏季（°C）</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">冬季（°C）</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">关键包装建议</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">紫禁城、长城、胡同、颐和园</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-10至5</td><td class="px-6 py-4">冬季厚外套，夏季防晒</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">迪士尼（可选），黄山一日游，深入城市</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–37</td><td class="px-6 py-4">0–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">全年潮湿；必备雨衣</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">广州</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–38</td><td class="px-6 py-4">10–18</td><td class="px-6 py-4">全年温暖；轻便衣物+雨具</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">深圳</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">12–20</td><td class="px-6 py-4">与广州相似；夏季沙滩装</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">熊猫、川菜、青城山、茶馆</td><td class="px-6 py-4">22–32</td><td class="px-6 py-4">2–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">经常被高估；全年穿着舒适</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">兵马俑、城墙、穆斯林美食之旅</td><td class="px-6 py-4">23–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-5至8</td><td class="px-6 py-4">与北京相似，但稍微暖和一些</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 您的中国之旅生存工具包</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">📶 游客最佳SIM卡和eSIM</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 中国需要的10个应用程序</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">导航等基本应用程序</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🚄 如何环游中国</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">轻松在城市之间导航</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>实用的建议——没有单一的官方来源。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>